                <mxCell id="a-noteElig" value="&lt;b&gt;Why no validation Lambda before Start:&lt;/b&gt; range &amp;amp; lead-time validation runs API-side in api-handler (instant form feedback; invalid requests never become executions). The Eligibility Gate is the machine&#39;s FIRST state — ineligible / paperwork → Escalate to Rep (tracked)." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#E0C068;fontColor=#7a5a10;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;" parent="1" vertex="1">
